    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'USG' Is a captivating vertical shoot 'em up featuring hand-drawn animations and a unique art style. Customise your run with multiple weapon upgrades </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist wakes up and finds herself connected to the unknown machine, her head hanging in the air and her hand holding the gamepad. She knows that clearing the game is the only way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Two game modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Roguelikes\u00a0</strong>: For players who love chaotic feelings. It comes with a level-up system that gives the player a chance to get a new weapon or upgrade their weapon.<br>- <strong>Challenge\u00a0</strong>: For players who love challenging, this mode allows players to equip only one sub-weapon.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hand-drawn animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple weapon upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of different enemy types </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online leaderboards.</p></li></ul>",
